			"widgets_values":[
				"Ensure the content of the video fills the entire frame without any margins or borders. { \"atmosphere\": \"Quiet, Warm, Magical, Loving\", \"characters\": [ { \"name\": \"A girl in a sweater and long dress\", \"personality\": \"A gentle and quiet young woman who loves the tranquility of nature.\", \"voiceStyle\": \"female, soft, gentle, and melodic\" }, { \"name\": \"A boy in distinctive clothing\", \"personality\": \"A considerate and calm young man who enjoys the simple moments with his loved one.\", \"voiceStyle\": \"male, calm, gentle, and soothing\" } ], \"storyboard1\": [ { \"storyboardContent\": \"0-2s: A super wide-angle shot of a vast, snow-covered Norwegian forest at dusk. The camera slowly pans from left to right, revealing a solitary, warm-lit cabin in the distance. [cut] 2-4s: A full-shot, using a horizontal lens, focuses on the wooden cabin. Snowflakes gently fall, and the warm light from the window creates a sense of tranquility. [cut] 4-6s: A medium shot from outside the window, showing a girl in a sweater and long dress standing inside, her silhouette softly outlined by the indoor light as she gazes at the falling snow. [cut] 6-8s: A medium long shot captures a boy in distinctive clothing carrying a bundle of firewood, walking towards the cabin. The camera follows him from the side. [cut] 8-10s: A close-up shot of the boy's feet crunching on the thick snow, with the sound of his footsteps clearly audible.\", \"storyboardAudioDescription\": \"0-4s: The gentle sound of wind blowing through the forest. 4-8s: The soft sound of falling snow. 8-10s: The distinct crunching sound of footsteps in the snow.\", \"dialogueLanguage\": \"Chinese\", \"storyboardDialogue\": \"None, don't let any character talk in the video\" } ] } HD, 8K, high quality, ultra detailed. Notice: The style of the video must be consistent with the style of the character image.",
